{"publicId":"cb194683-aad0-4378-9c4e-1a118e7d60b7","title":"现代法医学发现古埃及陪葬者39%有致命头部创伤","status":"settled","reportCount":1,"sourceCount":1,"firstReportAt":"2026-11-14T02:59:05.000Z","latestAt":"2026-11-14T02:59:05.000Z","digest":"普渡大学Campbell团队通过《Frontiers in Environmental Archaeology》发表法医研究报告，证实古埃及第一代国王陪葬者中约39%（18/46例）存在线性骨折等致命头部创伤证据。研究样本为已出土的46具王室陪葬者头骨，18例显示颅骨线性骨折，创伤类型与生前致命伤直接相关。ScienceDaily综合报道指出，该结论首次通过现代法医技术验证了古埃及陪葬者群体中头部创伤的高发生率。","digestUpdatedAt":"2026-11-14T04:46:03.253Z","summary":null,"excerpt":null,"latest":"普渡大学Campbell团队在《Frontiers in Environmental Archaeology》发表研究：约39%的王室陪葬者存在致命头部创伤证据","latestReport":{"id":"q31k5hpwxj5bunek5jr9awamu"},"whyHot":{"participants48h":0,"newParticipants6h":0,"recentReports24h":0,"observationComplete":true,"rank":null},"developments":[{"factId":"ftocVIVqYP3s","title":"现代法医学揭示了古埃及第一代国王的陪葬者可能遭受了致命头部创伤","firstReportAt":"2026-11-14T02:59:05.000Z","reportCount":1,"representative":{"id":"q31k5hpwxj5bunek5jr9awamu","title":"普渡大学Campbell团队在《Frontiers in Environmental Archaeology》发表研究：约39%的王室陪葬者存在致命头部创伤证据","summary":"普渡大学Campbell团队在《Frontiers in Environmental Archaeology》发表研究，通过法医分析证实约39%的王室陪葬者（样本量46人）存在线性骨折等致命头部创伤证据。","source":{"name":"ScienceDaily 综合","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-11-14T02:59:05.000Z","selected":false}}],"officialReports":[],"timeline":[{"id":"q31k5hpwxj5bunek5jr9awamu","title":"普渡大学Campbell团队在《Frontiers in Environmental Archaeology》发表研究：约39%的王室陪葬者存在致命头部创伤证据","summary":"普渡大学Campbell团队在《Frontiers in Environmental Archaeology》发表研究，通过法医分析证实约39%的王室陪葬者（样本量46人）存在线性骨折等致命头部创伤证据。","source":{"name":"ScienceDaily 综合","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-11-14T02:59:05.000Z","selected":false}],"heat":[{"hour":"2026-11-14T06:00:00.000Z","heat":9.2,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-14T07:00:00.000Z","heat":8.9,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-14T08:00:00.000Z","heat":8.7,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-14T09:00:00.000Z","heat":8.4,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-14T10:00:00.000Z","heat":8.2,"participants":1},{"